Plugins
=======


status-check
------------
a python module called status-check.py
which is a salt module and gets installed to _modules/ within the file_roots specified by the master config file


How does it get installed:
third parties will place a directory in /srv/calamari/plugins/XYZ

*** either symlinking happens or this directory is speced in the salt config

How does this get dealt with in dev and prod?

Is it manual or automagic?


